# BEGIN ludius-monitor
# Remove with infra/monitor/homelab/remove-monitor.sh (it needs the BEGIN and END lines exactly as they are).
# Public site: Claustra login, then the loopback hop below. Claustra sees the real Host (monitor.ludius.se).
monitor.ludius.se {
	import claustra_forward http://127.0.0.1:18452
}

# Loopback-only hop. The box's tailscale serve answers only its MagicDNS name as Host (anything else is a 404) and
# passes that Host on unchanged, so the agent (Host 127.0.0.1:7452 only) needs the box-side Caddy fallback in the
# README (serve :8452 -> 127.0.0.1:7453 -> agent with Host rewritten). The snippet can't set header_up, so the Host
# rewrite lives here. Origin passes through unchanged (https://monitor.ludius.se), which the agent's allowed-origin
# setting accepts. WebSocket upgrades are proxied by Caddy without extra config.
http://:18452 {
	bind 127.0.0.1
	reverse_proxy __BOX_TAILNET_IP__:__TS_PORT__ {
		header_up Host __BOX_DNS_NAME__:__TS_PORT__
	}
}
# END ludius-monitor
